                                "text": "The app requests an unknown or custom permission. This may increase the the attack surface on the app if it does not verify the identity of the target app that provides the definition for the permission, which could allow unauthorized interaction with other apps on the device and expose data or functionality. This could also indicate that that the app can directly interact with other apps on the device without the user's consent."
